  "description": "Domain-Driven Design Architecture: Complete implementation of Repository and Unit of Work patterns with multi-database support (SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MySQL) and ASP.NET Core Identity integration for .NET 8+. Features include soft delete, audit trails, domain entities (DomainType/DomainValue), flexible context hierarchy, and comprehensive async operations.",
