  "releaseNotes": "🎉 Initial Release 1.0.0-beta\n\n\t\t\t✨ Features:\n\t\t\t• Multi-database support (SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MySQL)\n\t\t\t• Complete Repository and Unit of Work patterns\n\t\t\t• ASP.NET Core Identity integration with custom user entity\n\t\t\t• Soft delete with audit trail functionality\n\t\t\t• Domain entities (DomainType/DomainValue) for catalog management\n\t\t\t• Flexible context hierarchy (Base, Domain, Identity, Full)\n\t\t\t• Comprehensive async operations\n\t\t\t• Built-in pagination and advanced querying\n\t\t\t• Transaction support\n\t\t\t• Configurable through appsettings.json\n\n\t\t\t📦 Architecture:\n\t\t\t• Clean Architecture compliance\n\t\t\t• Domain-Driven Design patterns\n\t\t\t• Dependency Injection ready\n\t\t\t• .NET 8+ optimized\n\n\t\t\t📖 Documentation: Complete README with examples and best practices",
